WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.067 --> 00:00:17.852
The king never forgot my refusal to take the rest of the Blefuscan ships.

2
00:00:17.853 --> 00:00:24.787
I had prevented the Blefuscans from attacking Lilliput, but he was still angry with me.

3
00:00:24.788 --> 00:00:28.419
Some of the king's men agreed with my decision.

4
00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:32.531
"You did the right thing," one of them told me.

5
00:00:32.532 --> 00:00:36.632
Not everyone, however, felt the same way.

6
00:00:36.633 --> 00:00:42.032
"You are a traitor," another of the king's advisers growled at me.

7
00:00:42.033 --> 00:00:47.466
Through my friends in the palace, I heard that I now had some secret enemies.

8
00:00:47.467 --> 00:00:52.178
From then on, they and the king were against me.

9
00:00:52.179 --> 00:00:54.631
About three weeks passed.

10
00:00:54.632 --> 00:01:01.228
One day, the Blefuscan king sent six of his officials to Lilliput to speak for him.

11
00:01:01.229 --> 00:01:05.112
The officials had a long meeting with the Lilliputian king.

12
00:01:05.113 --> 00:01:10.367
Because I was still one of his chief officials, I was at the meeting.

13
00:01:10.368 --> 00:01:18.106
"Your Majesty," said the chief official from Blefuscu, "our king would like to make peace with you.

14
00:01:18.107 --> 00:01:22.182
Blefuscu and Lilliput have been at war for too long.

15
00:01:22.183 --> 00:01:25.571
Many of our people have died or been hurt."

16
00:01:25.572 --> 00:01:30.997
"It has been a long war," sighed the king.

17
00:01:30.998 --> 00:01:36.813
He and the visiting officials discussed how their countries could get along without fighting.

18
00:01:36.814 --> 00:01:42.125
The king of Lilliput wanted the king of Blefuscu to agree to certain conditions.

19
00:01:42.126 --> 00:01:47.381
After hours of discussion, the two sides reached an agreement.

20
00:01:47.382 --> 00:01:50.522
"I accept your king's peace offer,"

21
00:01:50.523 --> 00:01:53.092
the king of Lilliput said finally.

22
00:01:53.093 --> 00:01:57.640
"Tell him that I will have my chief official write up an agreement.

23
00:01:57.641 --> 00:02:00.440
Then your king and I will sign it."

24
00:02:00.441 --> 00:02:04.951
I was surprised but happy to hear Lilliput's king say this.

25
00:02:04.952 --> 00:02:08.459
The two countries would no longer be at war.

26
00:02:08.460 --> 00:02:12.667
The next day, the Blefuscan officials came to see me.

27
00:02:12.668 --> 00:02:18.828
"Our king has heard of your refusal to take the rest of his ships," the chief official said.

28
00:02:18.829 --> 00:02:20.878
"He asked me to thank you.

29
00:02:20.879 --> 00:02:23.440
He thinks you are a generous giant.

30
00:02:23.441 --> 00:02:27.424
He invites you to come to Blefuscu for a visit."

31
00:02:27.425 --> 00:02:32.831
"I would be delighted to travel to Blefuscu and meet your king," I replied.

32
00:02:32.832 --> 00:02:36.582
"I will ask the king of Lilliput for his permission to visit soon."

33
00:02:36.583 --> 00:02:41.208
The Blefuscans were no longer angry with me for taking their ships.

34
00:02:41.209 --> 00:02:45.605
I was happy that they were ready to forgive and forget.

35
00:02:45.606 --> 00:02:48.373
Our meeting continued for a few hours.

36
00:02:48.374 --> 00:02:51.831
The Blefuscan officials were curious about me.

37
00:02:51.832 --> 00:02:57.033
They had never met a giant before, and they asked me many questions.

38
00:02:57.034 --> 00:03:02.350
"Would you do something to show us how strong you are?" one asked.

39
00:03:02.351 --> 00:03:05.098
"Of course," I replied.

40
00:03:05.099 --> 00:03:08.625
Just outside my house was a large rock.

41
00:03:08.626 --> 00:03:12.130
It was much bigger than the tiny Blefuscans.

42
00:03:12.131 --> 00:03:14.992
I picked it up with both my hands.

43
00:03:14.993 --> 00:03:17.357
Even for me it was quite heavy.

44
00:03:17.358 --> 00:03:22.148
I threw it into an empty field as the Blefuscans watched.

45
00:03:22.149 --> 00:03:27.138
"Your strength is amazing!" the chief official exclaimed.

46
00:03:27.139 --> 00:03:31.170
When the visit ended, he repeated his invitation.

47
00:03:31.171 --> 00:03:35.516
"Come to visit us soon in Blefuscu," he said.

48
00:03:35.517 --> 00:03:39.240
"I will give a good report of you to our king."

49
00:03:39.241 --> 00:03:43.909
A few days later, I had a chance to speak to the king of Lilliput.

50
00:03:43.910 --> 00:03:46.567
"Your Majesty," I said.

51
00:03:46.568 --> 00:03:49.812
"The king of Blefuscu has invited me to visit his island.

52
00:03:49.813 --> 00:03:51.203
I would like to go.

53
00:03:51.204 --> 00:03:53.926
May I have your permission, please?"

54
00:03:53.927 --> 00:03:59.862
"Yes," the king replied, although his manner was quite cold.

55
00:03:59.863 --> 00:04:02.051
"You may visit Blefuscu.

56
00:04:02.052 --> 00:04:08.641
But let me know before you leave Lilliput."
